his brush oil, even his calligraphy pen,
the impression he has given...

909
00:44:06,950 --> 00:44:09,200
我看咱们听得也够受的了，
I think we've probably heard enough,

910
00:44:09,200 --> 00:44:12,120
您要是没意见就打住吧，真是谢谢您嘞。
That's alright with you, thank you very much.

911
